msgstr "What it does"

#: includes/class-settings.php:355
msgid "Ejemplo"
msgstr "Example"

#: includes/class-settings.php:361
msgid ""
"Código de un signo (lista de Gardiner). Sin separador, los signos se suceden "
"en la línea."
msgstr ""
"Code of a sign (Gardiner list). Without a separator, signs follow each other "
"on the line."

#: includes/class-settings.php:366
msgid "Apila signos en vertical (cuadratura)"
msgstr "Stacks signs vertically (quadrat)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:371
msgid "Agrupa signos en horizontal"
msgstr "Groups signs horizontally"

#: includes/class-settings.php:376
msgid "Yuxtapone signos en la misma línea"
msgstr "Juxtaposes signs on the same line"

#: includes/class-settings.php:380
msgid "espacio"
msgstr "space"

#: includes/class-settings.php:391
msgid "Cartucho / cerramiento"
msgstr "Cartouche / enclosure"

#: includes/class-settings.php:396 includes/class-settings.php:467
msgid "Anillo shen"
msgstr "Shen ring"

#: includes/class-settings.php:401
msgid "Superpone un signo sobre otro"
msgstr "Overlays one sign on another"

#: includes/class-settings.php:406
msgid "Rota el signo anterior (sufijo tras el signo)"
msgstr "Rotates the previous sign (suffix after the sign)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:411
msgid "Marca el texto en rojo (papiros; sufijo)"
msgstr "Marks the text red (papyri; suffix)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:416
msgid "Corchetes literales (no es un cartucho)"
msgstr "Literal brackets (not a cartouche)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:422
msgid "Cartuchos (todas las variantes)"
msgstr "Cartouches (all variants)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:426
msgid ""
"Los cartuchos (nombres reales dentro de un óvalo) se escriben con los "
"cerramientos < y >. El óvalo se adapta al contenido: si apilas signos con \":"
"\", el cartucho se vuelve vertical."
msgstr ""
"Cartouches (royal names inside an oval) are written with the < and > "
"enclosures. The oval adapts to the content: if you stack signs with \":\", "
"the cartouche becomes vertical."

#: includes/class-settings.php:436 includes/class-settings.php:507
#: includes/class-settings.php:548
msgid "Resultado"
msgstr "Result"

#: includes/class-settings.php:442
msgid "Cartucho simple"
msgstr "Simple cartouche"

#: includes/class-settings.php:447
msgid "Cartucho con un nombre real (Menkheperre)"
msgstr "Cartouche with a royal name (Menkheperre)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:452
msgid "Cartucho con una cuadratura (más alto)"
msgstr "Cartouche with a quadrat (taller)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:457
msgid "CARTUCHO VERTICAL: signos apilados; el óvalo crece en altura"
msgstr "VERTICAL CARTOUCHE: stacked signs; the oval grows taller"

#: includes/class-settings.php:462
msgid "Cartucho con dos palabras yuxtapuestas"
msgstr "Cartouche with two juxtaposed words"

#: includes/class-settings.php:472
msgid "Cerramiento amurallado"
msgstr "Walled enclosure"

#: includes/class-settings.php:477
msgid "Cartucho, variante H"
msgstr "Cartouche, H variant"

#: includes/class-settings.php:482
msgid ""
"Cartucho con un signo inicial dentro (complemento fonético: s, b, h, 1…)"
msgstr ""
"Cartouche with an initial sign inside (phonetic complement: s, b, h, 1…)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:487
msgid "Cartucho con b inicial"
msgstr "Cartouche with initial b"

#: includes/class-settings.php:493
msgid "Orientación, rotación y sombreado"
msgstr "Orientation, rotation and shading"

#: includes/class-settings.php:497
msgid ""
"Para cambiar la orientación de toda la línea usa la opción \"Dirección\" del "
"bloque (derecha → izquierda, como el egipcio clásico). Para rotar o sombrear "
"un signo concreto, los modificadores van DESPUÉS del signo (sufijo):"
msgstr ""
"To change the orientation of the whole line, use the block's \"Direction\" "
"option (right to left, like classical Egyptian). To rotate or shade a single "
"sign, the modifiers go AFTER the sign (suffix):"

#: includes/class-settings.php:513
msgid "Rota el signo anterior (variantes de la fuente)"
msgstr "Rotates the previous sign (font variants)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:518
msgid "Rota el signo anterior 90°, 180° o 270°"
msgstr "Rotates the previous sign 90°, 180° or 270°"

#: includes/class-settings.php:523
msgid "Transposiciones horizontal, vertical y de reordenación"
msgstr "Horizontal, vertical and reordering transpositions"

#: includes/class-settings.php:528
msgid "Sombreado del signo anterior (1-4 = esquinas)"
msgstr "Shades the previous sign (1-4 = corners)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:537
#, php-format
msgid ""
"También puedes marcar un fragmento en rojo (papiros) escribiendo %s al final "
"del texto."
msgstr ""
"You can also mark a fragment in red (papyri) by typing %s at the end of the "
"text."

#: includes/class-settings.php:543
msgid "Ejemplos completos"
msgstr "Complete examples"

#: includes/class-settings.php:547
msgid "Texto MdC"
msgstr "MdC text"

#: includes/class-settings.php:564
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Si no recuerdas la codificación Unicode de un fragmento, usa el %s de esta "
"misma página para componer el texto y copiarlo."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:570
msgid "Shortcode [hiero]"
msgstr "Shortcode [hiero]"

#: includes/class-settings.php:574
msgid ""
"El shortcode se usa en el editor clásico. Acepta la transliteración MdC "
"directamente (se convierte al vuelo) o la codificación Unicode jeroglífica, "
"y se integra en el texto sin romperlo:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings.php:584
msgid "Atributo"
msgstr "Attribute"

#: includes/class-settings.php:585
msgid "Valores"
msgstr "Values"

#: includes/class-settings.php:586
msgid "Descripción"
msgstr "Description"

#: includes/class-settings.php:590
msgid "Tamaño de los signos (por defecto: el de los ajustes)."
msgstr "Sign size (default: the one from settings)."

#: includes/class-settings.php:591
msgid "Color de los signos (vacío = hereda el tema)."
msgstr "Sign color (empty = inherits the theme)."

#: includes/class-settings.php:592
msgid "Alineación del bloque."
msgstr "Block alignment."

#: includes/class-settings.php:593
msgid "Dirección: izquierda→derecha o derecha→izquierda."
msgstr "Direction: left to right or right to left."

#: includes/class-settings.php:594
msgid "Separación entre signos."
msgstr "Sign separation."

#: includes/class-settings.php:595
msgid "Patrón de sombreado de los signos dañados."
msgstr "Shading pattern for damaged signs."

#: includes/class-settings.php:596
msgid "Altura de línea (multiplicador)."
msgstr "Line height (multiplier)."

#: includes/class-settings.php:597
msgid "Permitir saltos de línea en fragmentos largos."
msgstr "Allow line breaks in long fragments."

#: includes/class-settings.php:601
msgid "Consejos y preguntas frecuentes"
msgstr "Tips and FAQ"

#: includes/class-settings.php:607
#, php-format
msgid ""
"La fuente NewGardiner se sirve desde el propio plugin. Si el hosting no "
"permitió incluirla (límite de subida), el plugin la carga automáticamente "
"desde la CDN oficial de HieroJax (%s)."
msgstr ""
"The NewGardiner font is served from the plugin itself. If the host prevented "
"including it (upload limit), the plugin loads it automatically from the "
"official HieroJax CDN (%s)."

#: includes/class-settings.php:615
msgid ""
"Si un código MdC no está aún codificado en Unicode, la vista previa muestra "
"el carácter � y el editor avisa. Revisa el código o usa la codificación "
"Unicode manual."
msgstr ""
"If an MdC code is not yet encoded in Unicode, the preview shows the � "
"character and the editor warns. Check the code or use the manual Unicode "
"encoding."

#: includes/class-settings.php:623
msgid ""
"Los scripts y la fuente solo se cargan en páginas que contienen "
"jeroglíficos, para no ralentizar el resto del sitio."
msgstr ""
"Scripts and the font are only loaded on pages containing hieroglyphs, so the "
"rest of the site stays fast."

#: includes/class-settings.php:632
msgid ""
"El bloque se personaliza por cada inserción desde su panel de opciones; los "
"valores por defecto de esta página solo afectan a bloques nuevos y al "
"shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Each block can be customized individually from its options panel; the "
"defaults on this page only affect new blocks and the shortcode."

